# Neuromorphic / Event Camera Demo

This repo shows:
1. A real-time "event camera" style view using a normal webcam (`event_camera_live.py`).
## 1. Live Webcam Demo (Python)

`webCamCapturewNeuro4TikTokv2.py` opens a webcam and renders:
- Top panel: standard frame-based camera feed.
- Bottom panel: event-style feed. Pixels flash when brightness changes.

### Controls
- `s` toggles label style (`STANDARD CAMERA / EVENT CAMERA` vs `FRAME-BASED / EVENT-BASED`)
- `l` shows/hides labels
- `q` quits

### Run it
```bash
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate  # Windows: venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python event_camera_live.py

